comment.narrative:
Aleppo: due to the earthquake and prioritizing the emergency response, the distribution has been postponed and is expected to take place by the end of July.
Rural Damascus: the beneficiary list is being cross-checked by SARC medical department case by case, to ensure the beneficiries are matching the selection criteria.
The delay on this activity is also due to the instability of the market, exchange rate is volatile and suppliers constantly change their prices. We are finding the best way of being cost efficient as well as maintaining our internal procurement procedures.;
